        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "Next.js DeveloperJob Title\n \n**Next.js Developer / Frontend Developer** \n\n\n\n Role Summary\n \n We are looking for an experienced\n **Next.js Developer** \n to develop modern, scalable, high\\-performance web applications. The ideal candidate should have strong hands\\-on experience with\n **Next.js, React, JavaScript/TypeScript, REST APIs, and modern frontend development practices** \n .\n \n\n\n Key Responsibilities\n * Develop and maintain scalable web applications using\n **Next.js and React**\n* Build reusable, maintainable, and high\\-quality frontend components\n* Implement\n **Server\\-Side Rendering (SSR), Static Site Generation (SSG), and client\\-side rendering** \n where appropriate\n* Integrate frontend applications with\n **REST APIs and backend services**\n* Convert UI/UX designs into responsive and functional web pages\n* Optimize applications for\n **performance, scalability, SEO, and usability**\n* Implement authentication, authorization, routing, and application state management\n* Troubleshoot application issues and perform code optimization\n* Write clean, reusable, testable, and maintainable code\n* Participate in code reviews and follow frontend development standards\n* Work closely with UI/UX designers, backend developers, QA engineers, and business teams\n* Support application deployment and CI/CD processes\n\n\n Must\\-Have Skills\n * Strong hands\\-on experience with\n **Next.js**\n* Strong experience with\n **React.js**\n* Strong knowledge of\n **JavaScript ES6\\+**\n* Experience with\n **TypeScript**\n* Strong understanding of\n **HTML5 and CSS3**\n* Experience developing\n **responsive web applications**\n* Experience integrating\n **REST APIs**\n* Good understanding of:\n\t+ SSR\n\t+ SSG\n\t+ Client\\-Side Rendering\n\t+ Routing\n\t+ Component\\-based architecture\n* Experience with state management solutions such as:\n\t+ Redux\n\t+ Redux Toolkit\n\t+ Context API\n\t+ Zustand or similar\n* Experience with\n **Git/version control**\n* Understanding of frontend performance optimization\n* Good debugging and problem\\-solving skills\n\n\n Good\\-to\\-Have Skills\n * Tailwind CSS, Material UI, Bootstrap, or similar UI frameworks\n* GraphQL\n* Jest, React Testing Library, Cypress, or Playwright\n* Node.js knowledge\n* Authentication using OAuth/OIDC/JWT\n* Docker\n* CI/CD pipelines\n* Azure, AWS, or other cloud platforms\n* Headless CMS integration\n* Accessibility standards such as\n **WCAG**\n* Experience working in\n **Agile/Scrum** \n teams",
